      property="og:description"
      content="Paarth is a tech enthusiast from Singapore and India, and he's passionate about web development and data science. Currently studying at North London Collegiate School in Dubai, he brings creativity, curiosity, and a keen eye for innovation to every project. Explore his journey and insights!"
    />
